WEBVTT

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:33.941
If we passively accept this premise

00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:40.448
that the only sports worth watching
are those played at the apex of humanity,

00:02:40.448 --> 00:02:45.453
then we have baked into our sports world
a reason for why women's sports don't ...

00:02:46.287 --> 00:02:47.455
and can't ...

00:02:47.997 --> 00:02:49.373
and won't matter.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:51.918
For example:

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.921
"Call me when women can dunk"

00:02:55.296 --> 00:02:57.840
is a thing that people have long said.

00:02:58.216 --> 00:03:01.510
(Laughter)